WEBVTT

01:30.980 --> 01:34.940
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.020 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 10]

01:46.950 --> 01:48.750
Enough with your honeyed words.

01:49.120 --> 01:51.039
I'm leading troops to battle imminently

01:51.039 --> 01:52.200
and have no patience
for long-winded speeches.

01:52.200 --> 01:53.060
Speak plainly!

01:55.120 --> 01:55.979
Your Highness,

01:56.310 --> 01:57.110
do you realize

01:57.200 --> 01:59.039
how many carts are needed

01:59.640 --> 02:01.900
to transport 24 million taels of silver?

02:02.400 --> 02:04.430
It would require
over a hundred large carts

02:04.430 --> 02:06.000
and over a hundred strong men
to manage them.

02:06.000 --> 02:06.920
The route would also pass

02:06.920 --> 02:08.470
through numerous prefectures and counties.

02:08.470 --> 02:09.710
May Your Highness please clarify

02:09.710 --> 02:11.770
what should be written
on the banners.

02:11.770 --> 02:12.590
What banners?

02:13.030 --> 02:14.030
When transporting

02:14.030 --> 02:15.430
such a vast sum of silver by cart,

02:15.430 --> 02:16.190
the banners

02:16.230 --> 02:18.160
must clearly state their purpose.

02:18.210 --> 02:19.630
Is it
for Your Highness's military provisions

02:19.630 --> 02:21.960
or for the sustenance
of your royal household?

02:21.960 --> 02:22.750
We Eight Families of Hedong

02:22.750 --> 02:23.810
have deliberated.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.950
Even if we must
melt our cauldrons for scrap

02:25.950 --> 02:26.870
and risk our lives,

02:26.870 --> 02:28.150
we will raise this sum.

02:28.750 --> 02:30.910
Your Highness licks blood
from the blade's edge,

02:30.910 --> 02:32.630
risking your life for the nation.

02:32.630 --> 02:33.120
Should we

02:33.120 --> 02:34.320
quibble over silver,

02:34.680 --> 02:36.910
we'd be ungrateful wretches.

02:38.190 --> 02:39.630
You should have said so earlier

02:39.630 --> 02:41.630
and spared yourselves this ordeal.

02:42.250 --> 02:44.060
Write out an IOU for Li Baiwan

02:44.280 --> 02:45.140
and summon him.

02:45.430 --> 02:46.630
That old fellow really knows
how to get things done.

02:46.630 --> 02:47.690
No, Your Highness,

02:47.750 --> 02:48.550
that won't do!

02:49.320 --> 02:50.720
We were just discussing—

02:51.190 --> 02:52.870
we can provide the funds,

02:53.079 --> 02:53.710
but we cannot

02:53.710 --> 02:54.520
let Li Baiwan

02:54.560 --> 02:55.490
reap the credit.

02:56.280 --> 02:57.150
Silver looks the same

02:57.150 --> 02:58.000
everywhere.

02:58.430 --> 02:58.750
Is

02:59.079 --> 02:59.870
Li Baiwan's silver

02:59.870 --> 03:01.130
any shinier than ours?

03:02.360 --> 03:03.630
Your Highness, imagine

03:03.630 --> 03:05.630
if you campaigned through great hardship

03:05.630 --> 03:07.470
only to see another take the glory—

03:07.470 --> 03:08.820
could you stomach that?

03:10.000 --> 03:10.680
Moreover,

03:11.630 --> 03:12.590
the Eight Families of Hedong

03:12.590 --> 03:14.280
are influential clans
with centuries of history.

03:14.280 --> 03:16.280
From the provincial capital
to the imperial court,

03:16.280 --> 03:17.230
each of them

03:17.310 --> 03:19.800
has allies among the imperial censors
and ministers.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.520
If Your Highness oppresses us
too harshly,

03:21.520 --> 03:23.579
this goodwill may turn to grievance.

03:24.030 --> 03:25.360
Truth be told, we intend

03:26.150 --> 03:28.079
to give more than 24 million taels—

03:28.430 --> 03:29.910
considerably more.

03:31.430 --> 03:32.840
Whatever Li Wantang paid

03:32.870 --> 03:34.470
to enlist your pressure,

03:34.710 --> 03:35.910
we will match.

03:38.280 --> 03:40.120
Such a sharp tongue!

03:41.000 --> 03:41.880
I am

03:41.910 --> 03:43.400
a prince leading armies—

03:44.079 --> 03:45.680
do you take me for a merchant?

03:46.280 --> 03:49.000
We beg Your Highness
to leave us a path to survival.

03:49.000 --> 03:50.460
Then state your proposal.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.170
As you command.

03:53.030 --> 03:53.840
Since Your Highness

03:53.840 --> 03:55.280
campaigns along the Yellow River,

03:55.280 --> 03:56.740
let this sum be designated

03:56.800 --> 03:59.450
as military provisions

03:59.750 --> 04:01.680
from the Eight Families of Hedong.

04:02.870 --> 04:04.010
But the amount

04:04.520 --> 04:05.570
is staggering—

04:06.030 --> 04:07.120
once the silver carts roll out,

04:07.120 --> 04:08.590
it will cause an uproar.

04:09.590 --> 04:11.120
We need not fear memorials

04:11.150 --> 04:12.000
from censors,

04:12.310 --> 04:14.520
for Your Highness' merits overshadow all.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.440
What we dread is

04:15.870 --> 04:17.440
others reaching out

04:17.600 --> 04:18.630
to claim a share,

04:19.040 --> 04:20.370
spoiling the endeavor.

04:20.490 --> 04:21.480
Thus, I propose

04:21.829 --> 04:24.030
transporting the silver to the capital

04:24.240 --> 04:26.410
to exchange for banknotes
from the Four Major Banks—

04:26.410 --> 04:27.870
portable and convenient.

04:28.200 --> 04:29.070
Your Highness could then

04:29.070 --> 04:30.240
simply tuck them into your robe.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.640
Wouldn't that be better?

04:33.390 --> 04:33.950
Good.

04:34.480 --> 04:35.800
Then produce the banknotes.

04:35.800 --> 04:36.390
How long?

04:36.920 --> 04:38.980
Two months to load the silver,

04:39.070 --> 04:40.130
reach the capital,

04:40.159 --> 04:41.740
convert to banknotes,

04:41.920 --> 04:42.980
and deliver to you—

04:43.870 --> 04:46.530
this already requires traveling
day and night.

04:51.190 --> 04:52.050
Your Highness,

04:53.190 --> 04:54.140
behold:

04:54.750 --> 04:56.560
the signed pledge
of the Eight Families of Hedong

04:56.560 --> 04:57.760
with personal seals.

04:57.909 --> 04:59.490
[Donation of 24 million taels
by the Eight Families of Hedong]

04:58.240 --> 04:59.890
"Donation of 24 million taels

04:59.520 --> 05:00.820
[To Prince Shen,
redeemable against this document.]

05:00.160 --> 05:01.020
to Prince Shen,

05:01.240 --> 05:03.300
redeemable against this document."

05:03.800 --> 05:05.600
Once you receive the banknotes,

05:05.680 --> 05:07.480
simply return this slip.

05:14.150 --> 05:15.610
How can I trust

05:16.000 --> 05:17.360
this flimsy paper

05:17.680 --> 05:19.990
to be worth 24 million?

05:20.360 --> 05:21.190
You expect me

05:21.480 --> 05:23.080
to release you based on this?

05:23.390 --> 05:25.040
Do you take me for a child?

05:26.240 --> 05:27.100
Your Highness,

05:27.310 --> 05:28.000
do not underestimate

05:28.000 --> 05:29.070
this thin slip.

05:29.830 --> 05:31.960
Could Li Baiwan produce such a pledge?

05:32.240 --> 05:32.950
The Eight Families of Hedong

05:32.950 --> 05:34.360
have thrived over 300 years—

05:34.360 --> 05:35.880
in both capital and credibility,

05:35.880 --> 05:37.159
we are, perhaps,

05:37.190 --> 05:38.950
a slight step above Li Baiwan.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.240
Unless Your Highness intends

05:42.240 --> 05:43.040
to destroy us,

05:43.040 --> 05:44.680
in which case I shall say no more

05:44.680 --> 05:46.070
and await execution.

05:49.470 --> 05:50.800
You wouldn't dare flee.

05:51.310 --> 05:53.770
If I don't see those banknotes
in two months,

05:54.680 --> 05:55.360
my troops

05:55.390 --> 05:57.190
will raze your ratholes. Now go!

05:57.600 --> 05:58.260
Get out now!

05:58.750 --> 05:59.610
As you command.

06:06.720 --> 06:07.920
Pack up the supplies.

06:07.950 --> 06:09.480
We break camp for Shandong.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.390
A new imperial decree every single day!

06:11.390 --> 06:12.390
This is trying the patience
of even someone like me.

06:12.390 --> 06:13.310
At once.

06:21.800 --> 06:22.600
Young Master,

06:22.720 --> 06:24.560
the manager of Taiyufeng, Mr. Gu,
is here to see you.

06:24.560 --> 06:25.600
Tell him I'm not in.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.240
Wait—

06:28.120 --> 06:28.980
why refuse him?

06:30.070 --> 06:31.800
He'll think I'm scheming against him.

06:31.800 --> 06:32.650
Scheming?

06:34.070 --> 06:35.240
He's with Taiyufeng,

06:35.240 --> 06:36.310
and you're with Wanyuandang.

06:36.310 --> 06:38.040
If you're not scheming against him,
then who?

06:38.040 --> 06:38.570
Go ahead.

06:39.070 --> 06:39.560
Ask him

06:39.630 --> 06:40.480
when he plans to hand over

06:40.480 --> 06:42.280
those 3 million taels of silver.

06:42.310 --> 06:44.110
And how did he even get released?

06:55.950 --> 06:57.010
How could the boy

06:57.040 --> 06:58.170
be so soft-hearted?

06:59.040 --> 07:00.750
The Young Master is still young.

07:00.750 --> 07:01.800
He finally made a friend

07:01.800 --> 07:02.820
here in Shanxi.

07:03.070 --> 07:03.950
A friend?

07:05.720 --> 07:08.720
Do we need to come all the way
to Shanxi to make friends?

07:08.720 --> 07:09.600
We're here to take

07:09.600 --> 07:10.750
over these draft banks—

07:10.750 --> 07:11.680
this is a battlefield!

07:11.680 --> 07:13.310
There's no room for sentimentality.

07:13.310 --> 07:14.390
You're right, you're right.

07:14.390 --> 07:15.650
I'll talk to him again.

07:17.320 --> 07:18.510
How was that man released?

07:18.510 --> 07:19.770
Why wasn't I informed?

07:21.800 --> 07:23.190
I was concerned, Master,
that you would be angered

07:23.190 --> 07:24.830
and planned to tell you later.

07:24.830 --> 07:26.070
That lad convinced the eight families

07:26.070 --> 07:27.870
to sign a pledge to His Highness,

07:27.920 --> 07:29.160
guaranteeing they'd deliver

07:29.160 --> 07:30.560
24 million taels in Four Major Banks

07:30.560 --> 07:31.600
within 2 months.

07:32.240 --> 07:34.240
His Highness was in a hurry
to march to Shandong,

07:34.240 --> 07:35.370
so he agreed.

07:36.190 --> 07:37.050
Unacceptable!

07:37.920 --> 07:38.800
I'll speak to His Highness.

07:38.800 --> 07:40.800
His Highness has already departed.

07:42.159 --> 07:43.260
Fool!

07:44.720 --> 07:47.070
With silver shining
right before their eyes,

07:47.070 --> 07:48.800
he smugly walked away with a mere IOU

07:48.800 --> 07:51.000
instead of crushing the Eight Families

07:52.290 --> 07:54.070
while he had the chance.

07:54.830 --> 07:56.240
If he ever collects that debt,

07:56.240 --> 07:57.500
I'll take his surname!

07:58.600 --> 07:59.630
Whose idea was this?

07:59.630 --> 08:00.870
I heard it was that fellow surnamed Gu

08:00.870 --> 08:02.270
who negotiated the deal.

08:05.570 --> 08:08.370
[Pawnshop]

08:07.160 --> 08:07.680
Mr. Gu,

08:08.110 --> 08:09.970
-you know how I am...
-Say no more.

08:10.120 --> 08:11.310
I came to see you off.

08:12.170 --> 08:13.370
S-See me off? Why?

08:13.600 --> 08:18.190
[Yixiu Studio]

08:13.680 --> 08:15.480
After what your father has done—

08:15.630 --> 08:16.800
offending every draft bank in Shanxi

08:16.800 --> 08:18.120
from top to bottom—

08:18.600 --> 08:20.130
how could he possibly stay?

08:21.430 --> 08:23.030
Such a promising situation,

08:23.040 --> 08:23.970
utterly ruined.

08:24.480 --> 08:26.270
What a perfectly staged scene—

08:26.800 --> 08:30.260
and in the end, it's that kid
who walks away with all the credit.

08:33.080 --> 08:34.710
My father came to Shanxi

08:34.789 --> 08:36.510
with a meticulous plan.

08:38.270 --> 08:40.200
I suggest you simply join our side.

08:40.909 --> 08:41.510
Though his methods

08:41.510 --> 08:42.770
may seem underhanded,

08:42.960 --> 08:44.130
I see no flaws

08:44.390 --> 08:45.630
in his plan.

08:46.390 --> 08:47.720
You can't withstand it.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.320
I'll never respect business

08:49.790 --> 08:51.510
conducted through such tricks.

08:51.510 --> 08:53.240
I don't care how powerful he is.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.800
Within three months,

08:55.600 --> 08:57.120
I will make Taiping Bank

08:57.840 --> 08:59.300
close its doors in Shanxi.

09:00.180 --> 09:02.510
Otherwise, I'll write my name backwards.

09:08.150 --> 09:08.750
Mr. Gu,

09:09.600 --> 09:11.630
those are bold words.

09:12.680 --> 09:15.010
Your father relies solely on brute force.

09:15.150 --> 09:16.610
But in business,

09:16.940 --> 09:19.150
integrity is the foundation,
righteousness the root,

09:19.150 --> 09:20.480
circulation the means,

09:21.150 --> 09:22.610
and convenience the path.

09:23.550 --> 09:24.440
He has violated

09:24.830 --> 09:26.560
every one of these principles—

09:26.600 --> 09:27.660
he won't last long.

09:29.240 --> 09:31.380
It's that Gu lad again.

09:32.700 --> 09:33.160
Master,

09:33.200 --> 09:34.330
shall I once more...

09:39.960 --> 09:41.000
I have pressing matters

09:41.000 --> 09:42.530
to attend to in the capital.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.330
You stay.

09:43.790 --> 09:44.920
Your task is simple:

09:45.790 --> 09:47.190
spread the word

09:47.240 --> 09:49.320
that each of these eight families

09:49.630 --> 09:50.670
owes the court 3 million taels in silver—

09:50.670 --> 09:52.470
clearly documented in writing.

09:53.080 --> 09:55.010
Once an imperial decree is issued,

09:55.270 --> 09:56.480
no matter whose money it is,

09:56.480 --> 09:58.740
once sealed, it becomes state property.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.000
Trigger a bank run
among their depositors,

10:02.000 --> 10:03.550
and crush them one by one.

10:04.360 --> 10:06.090
I estimate within a few months,

10:06.840 --> 10:07.910
these eight families

10:07.910 --> 10:09.360
will have to trade

10:09.390 --> 10:10.590
all they have with me.

10:11.440 --> 10:12.720
We need to get

10:12.810 --> 10:14.510
the exclusive franchise
for Shanxi draft bank.

10:14.510 --> 10:16.320
We also need
to squeeze out all their reserves.

10:16.320 --> 10:17.120
I want Shanxi,

10:17.600 --> 10:19.730
and I also want King Li's treasure.

10:20.360 --> 10:21.760
What about His Highness?

10:24.550 --> 10:25.720
A dead man walking.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.240
I have nothing more to say about him.

10:33.480 --> 10:34.210
How did it go?

10:35.320 --> 10:36.670
He said you'd be kicked the hell out

10:36.670 --> 10:38.130
of Shanxi within 3 months.

10:40.360 --> 10:41.490
And what did you say?

10:41.790 --> 10:42.750
What could I say?

10:43.200 --> 10:45.600
How could you do
such ruthless plundering?

10:46.630 --> 10:47.910
I told him the Eight Families

10:47.910 --> 10:48.970
would be swallowed

10:49.550 --> 10:51.350
by Taiping Bank within 3 months.

10:57.440 --> 10:59.320
If you want to establish yourself here,

10:59.320 --> 11:00.630
bowing and scraping

11:00.630 --> 11:01.960
with a polite smile

11:02.240 --> 11:03.080
won't even

11:03.120 --> 11:05.080
leave you the scraps.

11:06.670 --> 11:08.330
Do you know what place this is?

11:08.360 --> 11:10.100
The origin of all draft banks.

11:10.150 --> 11:12.210
A gathering place of immense wealth.

11:13.750 --> 11:15.480
Rely on diligence alone,

11:15.510 --> 11:17.510
and you might never gain a foothold.

11:19.120 --> 11:21.720
To kill a snake,
you must strike its vital spot.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.390
Crush their hopes,

11:23.960 --> 11:25.360
and seize their essence.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.000
Young Master,

11:32.550 --> 11:34.120
now that's true insight.

11:34.440 --> 11:35.390
If I were you,

11:35.750 --> 11:37.030
I wouldn't bother with business.

11:37.030 --> 11:38.010
Return home now,

11:38.080 --> 11:39.790
stay by the Master's side
for a couple of years—

11:39.790 --> 11:42.120
and who in this world
could ever rival you?

11:47.820 --> 11:48.360
Mr. Gu.

11:48.790 --> 11:49.790
Why are you here again?

11:49.790 --> 11:50.390
What is it?

12:02.080 --> 12:03.940
The Eight Families have a message

12:03.950 --> 12:04.960
for Li Wantang.

12:07.010 --> 12:07.910
A businessman

12:08.630 --> 12:10.430
must abide by the business code.

12:10.570 --> 12:11.150
Do not continue to rely

12:11.150 --> 12:12.640
on power to bully others.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.500
Message received.

12:29.270 --> 12:30.530
What's wrong with him?

12:42.320 --> 12:44.250
What do you think of that young man?

12:46.390 --> 12:48.920
He was never meant
to remain in common waters.

12:51.970 --> 12:52.550
Master,

12:52.910 --> 12:54.900
with your discerning eye
honed by experience,

12:54.900 --> 12:55.900
what is your view?

13:17.550 --> 13:19.290
Was this idea

13:20.200 --> 13:22.140
suggested to you,

13:22.200 --> 13:24.080
or did you conceive it yourself?

13:25.200 --> 13:26.600
Back in the penal colony,

13:27.390 --> 13:28.120
when no one

13:28.150 --> 13:29.480
had much silver on hand,

13:29.840 --> 13:30.960
we often traded

13:30.980 --> 13:31.750
this way.

13:32.870 --> 13:34.510
Say I needed to hunt a tiger—

13:35.000 --> 13:36.600
I'd require spears, blades,

13:37.030 --> 13:38.630
tools, and provisions.

13:39.270 --> 13:40.930
I could only pledge repayment

13:41.000 --> 13:42.200
on the condition
that I successfully brought

13:42.200 --> 13:43.150
the tiger back.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.790
The shopkeeper would then make

13:47.000 --> 13:47.950
the same

13:48.080 --> 13:50.030
conditional pledge

13:50.150 --> 13:51.360
to the blacksmith.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.120
Over time,

13:53.550 --> 13:54.390
this method of transaction

13:54.390 --> 13:55.520
gained acceptance.

13:56.360 --> 13:57.150
That tiger might

13:57.150 --> 13:58.680
still be roaming the mountains,

13:58.680 --> 14:00.230
but among us,

14:00.390 --> 14:03.250
it had already been bought
and sold many times over.

14:09.770 --> 14:11.120
Great.

14:12.750 --> 14:13.360
Master,

14:13.960 --> 14:15.750
I committed 3 million taels of debt

14:15.750 --> 14:16.510
on their behalf

14:16.510 --> 14:18.110
without your prior consent.

14:18.460 --> 14:19.790
I ask your forgiveness.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.480
Explain your reasoning.

14:24.720 --> 14:26.650
There is no particular reasoning.

14:26.840 --> 14:27.970
I am simply betting—

14:31.630 --> 14:34.230
betting that
the Eight Families will prevail.

14:38.240 --> 14:39.570
Do you know

14:40.120 --> 14:42.060
which part of this entire affair

14:42.200 --> 14:44.510
I like the most?

14:47.120 --> 14:48.600
Those Eight Families

14:49.510 --> 14:51.440
possess wealth rivaling nations,

14:51.440 --> 14:52.900
immense financial power—

14:54.320 --> 14:55.450
their hidden assets

14:56.000 --> 14:59.550
are soon to be laid bare.

15:00.910 --> 15:01.370
Master—

15:03.200 --> 15:04.920
If this is about Chang Si,

15:05.320 --> 15:06.750
spare your words.

15:07.630 --> 15:10.380
You failed to complete the final task.

15:10.790 --> 15:12.190
Once it's accomplished,

15:12.320 --> 15:14.120
I'll release him—

15:15.120 --> 15:16.480
and you as well.

15:25.670 --> 15:27.110
What good

15:27.790 --> 15:29.650
would freeing Chang Si do for you?

15:30.910 --> 15:33.130
Let me show you a brighter path:

15:33.440 --> 15:34.080
you,

15:34.600 --> 15:36.800
as chief manager of the Eight Families—

15:36.840 --> 15:39.010
what prestige that would bring!

15:41.870 --> 15:42.510
Are you

15:43.550 --> 15:44.440
not tempted?

15:52.750 --> 15:54.410
Without Mr. Chang's release,

15:54.630 --> 15:56.200
no further dealings can proceed.

15:56.200 --> 15:57.800
I will discuss nothing else.

16:07.390 --> 16:10.630
[Taiping Bank]

16:15.610 --> 16:16.790
Excellent!

16:26.120 --> 16:28.250
Congratulations! Congratulations!

16:30.870 --> 16:31.670
Excellent!

16:34.500 --> 16:39.230
[We offer a 30% annual return
for the esteemed customers of Shanxi.]

16:38.030 --> 16:39.630
It's 30%! 30%!

16:39.960 --> 16:40.600
Open up!

16:41.030 --> 16:42.840
Taiyufeng, open your doors!

16:50.750 --> 16:52.210
Open up! Quickly, open up!

16:53.600 --> 16:54.290
Hurry!

16:54.360 --> 16:55.960
Taiyufeng, open your doors!

16:58.330 --> 17:02.510
[Taiping Bank]

16:59.440 --> 17:00.500
How's everything?

17:01.240 --> 17:02.170
Since midnight,

17:02.790 --> 17:03.480
Taiyufeng's entrance

17:03.480 --> 17:04.880
has been swarmed with people
demanding their money.

17:04.880 --> 17:06.160
It's completely packed now.

17:06.160 --> 17:07.829
They're refusing to open their shutters,

17:07.829 --> 17:09.589
and some have started smashing the doors—

17:09.589 --> 17:10.680
though they're still hesitant
to break in,

17:10.680 --> 17:11.750
given the firm's close ties

17:11.750 --> 17:13.200
with the county magistrate.

17:13.200 --> 17:14.200
I'd say it's only a matter of time

17:14.200 --> 17:15.030
before full-blown chaos erupts.

17:15.030 --> 17:16.310
Alright, here's what you do:

17:16.310 --> 17:17.310
spend more

17:17.480 --> 17:18.480
money,

17:18.520 --> 17:19.589
hire more people to blend into the crowd

17:19.589 --> 17:20.680
and listen to what's being said.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.280
Go, go now.

17:22.270 --> 17:22.849
Wait—come back.

17:22.849 --> 17:29.360
[Taiping Bank]

17:25.400 --> 17:26.599
Do we have our own men

17:26.630 --> 17:27.550
at Taiyufeng's entrance right now?

17:27.550 --> 17:28.069
Yes,

17:28.440 --> 17:29.700
I just came from there.

17:29.720 --> 17:30.650
When I left, 5 or 6

17:30.880 --> 17:31.750
of our guys were still

17:31.750 --> 17:32.610
keeping watch,

17:32.750 --> 17:33.880
taking turns reporting updates.

17:33.880 --> 17:34.310
Good.

17:34.400 --> 17:35.400
Now hurry back

17:35.420 --> 17:36.420
and instruct our men clearly:

17:36.420 --> 17:37.680
if the crowd eventually

17:37.680 --> 17:38.420
breaks in and starts

17:38.420 --> 17:39.270
beating people or looting,

17:39.270 --> 17:40.240
they must protect

17:40.240 --> 17:41.270
Mr. Gu at all costs.

17:41.270 --> 17:42.030
He is not to be harmed.

17:42.030 --> 17:42.920
That man is my brother.

17:42.920 --> 17:43.460
Make sure they remember this.

17:43.460 --> 17:44.190
Understood.

17:45.510 --> 17:46.310
Don't forget!

17:47.480 --> 17:48.280
Young Master,

17:48.550 --> 17:50.550
you certainly hold onto loyalties.

17:51.920 --> 17:52.480
What,

17:53.070 --> 17:54.800
am I not allowed to protect him?

17:55.710 --> 17:57.920
I'm just afraid
that even if you protect him,

17:57.920 --> 17:59.320
he may not appreciate it.

18:00.840 --> 18:02.160
I owe my foothold here

18:02.200 --> 18:03.400
to the help he gave me.

18:05.000 --> 18:09.720
Open up! Open up! Open up!

18:10.160 --> 18:11.880
Step aside!

18:12.550 --> 18:15.500
Move! Move! Move!

18:15.720 --> 18:17.960
Out of the way! Out of the way!

18:16.210 --> 18:20.990
[Taiyufeng]

18:20.200 --> 18:21.060
Step aside now!

18:25.420 --> 18:28.110
[Taiyufeng]

18:30.070 --> 18:31.900
We beseech Mr. Gu to appear!

18:32.030 --> 18:33.960
We beseech Mr. Gu to appear!

18:55.830 --> 18:56.550
Gentlemen.

18:58.070 --> 18:59.300
Sorry to keep you waiting.

18:59.300 --> 19:04.990
[Taiyufeng]

19:01.240 --> 19:02.300
Now that Taiyufeng

19:03.270 --> 19:05.000
has joined the Eight Families,

19:05.400 --> 19:08.200
there is absolutely no question
about our credit.

19:08.580 --> 19:10.200
We stand together,

19:10.480 --> 19:12.030
supporting and aiding one another.

19:12.030 --> 19:14.260
Today, everyone
who has come to withdraw silver

19:14.260 --> 19:15.480
will be paid in full—

19:16.230 --> 19:18.130
you will not be shorted a single cent.

19:18.130 --> 19:20.700
[Taiyufeng]

19:18.920 --> 19:20.400
Open the chests!

19:21.300 --> 19:23.610
♪ The world is full of reasons ♪

19:23.680 --> 19:25.040
♪ And tales of loyalty ♪

19:25.080 --> 19:28.090
♪ We should be just and compassionate ♪

19:28.170 --> 19:29.820
♪ Among the smoke
there is just one path ♪

19:29.860 --> 19:34.790
♪ I'll measure this life step by step ♪

19:34.880 --> 19:36.070
♪ All walks of life ♪

19:36.090 --> 19:37.420
♪ Each plays a part ♪

19:37.500 --> 19:39.350
♪ When curtains fall ♪

19:39.390 --> 19:40.850
♪ A legend starts ♪

19:40.910 --> 19:42.590
♪ Trade has its code ♪

19:42.610 --> 19:46.390
♪ I bear the code ♪

19:42.950 --> 19:44.910
[Taiyufeng]

19:46.480 --> 19:49.260
♪ The sun will always rise ♪

19:55.260 --> 19:56.520
You may take them down.

19:57.140 --> 20:00.370
[Taiyufeng]

19:59.580 --> 20:01.360
♪ I've read the Four Books
and Five Classics ♪

20:00.750 --> 20:02.000
May I ask your name, butler?

20:01.380 --> 20:03.050
♪ I've learned to be magnanimous ♪

20:02.830 --> 20:04.110
My humble surname is Zhai.

20:03.080 --> 20:05.630
♪ And forget the past grudges ♪

20:04.550 --> 20:06.680
I serve as the butler for Fencang Bank.

20:05.680 --> 20:07.680
♪ I've traveled through the years ♪

20:06.790 --> 20:11.160
[Taiyufeng]

20:07.110 --> 20:08.200
Madam has instructed

20:07.710 --> 20:09.310
♪ As life roughens my face ♪

20:08.880 --> 20:10.590
that once this silver is delivered,

20:09.350 --> 20:11.980
♪ I've felt the coldness between people ♪

20:10.720 --> 20:11.920
we are to ask no questions

20:11.920 --> 20:14.440
and follow Mr. Gu's arrangements
in all matters.

20:12.000 --> 20:15.110
♪ I've seen the vast snow ♪

20:14.960 --> 20:16.140
Thank you for your hard work,
Butler Zhai.

20:15.180 --> 20:18.140
♪ I was once held tightly by someone ♪

20:16.400 --> 20:18.110
Please accept these tokens
of appreciation.

20:18.110 --> 20:18.660
Mr. Gu,

20:18.210 --> 20:19.310
♪ The meaning of survival ♪

20:18.830 --> 20:19.870
that's really not necessary.

20:19.390 --> 20:21.280
♪ Is all about staying fed ♪

20:19.960 --> 20:21.510
Your men have also labored hard—

20:21.330 --> 20:22.780
♪ Turn around ♪

20:21.590 --> 20:22.830
let this buy them
a round of drinks.

20:22.810 --> 20:24.370
♪ And try to be brave ♪

20:23.200 --> 20:24.280
I insist.

20:24.430 --> 20:29.830
♪ The show is about to start ♪

20:27.240 --> 20:29.390
Mr. Gu has granted a reward—

20:29.640 --> 20:31.930
this is for everyone's drinks!

20:29.940 --> 20:32.200
♪ The world is full of reasons ♪

20:32.240 --> 20:33.880
Thank you, Mr. Gu!

20:32.270 --> 20:33.700
♪ And tales of loyalty ♪

20:33.790 --> 20:36.820
♪ We should be just and compassionate ♪

20:35.070 --> 20:35.800
Butler Zhai,

20:36.270 --> 20:37.420
have the cargo unloaded

20:36.870 --> 20:38.580
♪ Among the smoke
there is just one path ♪

20:37.440 --> 20:38.600
and the carts moved to the rear courtyard.

20:38.600 --> 20:43.320
♪ I'll measure this life step by step ♪

20:38.960 --> 20:39.590
Right away!

20:39.590 --> 20:40.890
Let's begin business—

20:42.200 --> 20:43.640
unload the silver!

20:43.410 --> 20:44.730
♪ All walks of life ♪

20:43.690 --> 20:46.030
[Taiyufeng]

20:44.760 --> 20:45.960
♪ Each plays a part ♪

20:46.020 --> 20:47.940
♪ When curtains fall ♪

20:46.130 --> 20:47.540
[Taiping Bank]

20:47.110 --> 20:47.710
Carts.

20:48.000 --> 20:48.590
The carts are here!

20:48.020 --> 20:49.410
♪ A legend starts ♪

20:48.640 --> 20:49.220
Carts?

20:49.400 --> 20:50.390
W-What carts?

20:49.480 --> 20:51.160
♪ Trade has its code ♪

20:50.480 --> 20:50.960
S-

20:51.230 --> 20:55.180
♪ I bear the code ♪

20:51.240 --> 20:52.140
Silver carts!

20:52.440 --> 20:54.310
The carts are fully loaded with silver.

20:54.310 --> 20:55.580
We followed them and saw it—

20:55.240 --> 20:57.850
♪ The sun will always rise ♪

20:55.640 --> 20:56.700
ingot after ingot.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.130
We counted

20:58.640 --> 20:59.830
and there were 6 carts up front,

20:59.830 --> 21:01.020
with more on the way.

21:01.200 --> 21:03.350
The Eight Families
have emptied their coffers.

21:03.350 --> 21:04.270
The crowd outside
waiting to withdraw silver

21:04.270 --> 21:04.880
is thinning by the minute.

21:04.880 --> 21:05.680
Are you mute?

21:05.680 --> 21:06.480
Speak up, damn it!

21:06.480 --> 21:07.200
Go tell them—

21:07.200 --> 21:08.200
if they don't withdraw today,

21:08.200 --> 21:08.880
an imperial decree

21:08.880 --> 21:10.030
might seal those banks shut

21:10.030 --> 21:11.190
for good one day!

21:11.310 --> 21:12.060
We tried!

21:12.160 --> 21:12.930
It's no use!

21:12.890 --> 21:17.080
[Taiyufeng]

21:13.680 --> 21:14.960
Judging by this situation,

21:14.960 --> 21:16.110
does Taiyufeng actually

21:16.110 --> 21:17.310
have the funds or not?

21:17.400 --> 21:18.640
We'd better withdraw the money.

21:18.640 --> 21:20.500
Who knows if there'll be anything left
if we wait any longer.

21:20.500 --> 21:22.250
[Taiyufeng]

21:21.160 --> 21:21.720
Look, look over there!

21:21.720 --> 21:22.920
More carts seem to be coming.

21:22.920 --> 21:23.720
Did Taiyufeng

21:23.720 --> 21:24.680
really owe the regime 3 million taels,

21:24.680 --> 21:25.240
or did they actually

21:25.240 --> 21:27.300
earn 3 million taels from the regime?

21:27.720 --> 21:28.450
Those people

21:28.720 --> 21:29.510
see the silver

21:29.510 --> 21:30.460
and feel reassured.

21:30.460 --> 21:31.480
They're afraid withdrawing their money

21:31.480 --> 21:32.170
will cost them interest.

21:32.170 --> 21:33.170
That's bullshit!

21:33.400 --> 21:34.480
Go and tell them

21:33.810 --> 21:35.490
[We offer a 30% annual return
for the esteemed customers of Shanxi.]

21:34.640 --> 21:35.920
that Taiping Bank offers 30% interest,

21:35.920 --> 21:36.750
which is higher than Taiyufeng's!

21:36.750 --> 21:37.200
But...

21:37.480 --> 21:38.680
then our men will be exposed!

21:38.530 --> 21:40.830
♪ The world is full of reasons ♪

21:38.750 --> 21:39.930
Just go!

21:40.910 --> 21:42.260
♪ And tales of loyalty ♪

21:42.310 --> 21:45.320
♪ We should be just and compassionate ♪

21:43.550 --> 21:45.430
Taiyufeng has secured

21:45.410 --> 21:47.050
♪ Among the smoke
there is just one path ♪

21:45.480 --> 21:46.270
an alliance with both
the Jin and Sun families.

21:45.530 --> 21:47.590
[Taiyufeng]

21:46.830 --> 21:47.710
It really doesn't look like

21:47.090 --> 21:52.010
♪ I'll measure this life step by step ♪

21:47.790 --> 21:49.360
they're in trouble.

21:50.920 --> 21:52.890
Since early this morning,

21:52.110 --> 21:53.300
♪ All walks of life ♪

21:52.960 --> 21:54.890
three shipments of silver
have arrived by cart.

21:53.320 --> 21:54.650
♪ Each plays a part ♪

21:54.720 --> 21:56.570
♪ When curtains fall ♪

21:55.270 --> 21:56.350
We might've panicked

21:56.350 --> 21:58.400
for nothing.

21:56.620 --> 21:58.080
♪ A legend starts ♪

21:58.140 --> 21:59.820
♪ This land so vast ♪

21:59.550 --> 22:00.310
We should still

21:59.840 --> 22:05.240
♪ I bear its weight ♪

22:00.310 --> 22:00.830
withdraw our money.

22:00.830 --> 22:01.200
Yes,

22:01.480 --> 22:02.810
better safe than sorry.

22:03.290 --> 22:06.310
[Taiyufeng]

22:04.590 --> 22:05.550
Line up properly for withdrawals!

22:05.310 --> 22:11.590
♪ The sun will always rise ♪

22:05.830 --> 22:06.550
Form a line right here!

22:06.370 --> 22:09.010
[Taiyufeng Draft Bank]

22:13.550 --> 22:15.550
Deliver this draft to the Li family,

22:15.880 --> 22:16.920
and the thirty thousand taels

22:16.920 --> 22:18.850
will be credited to their account.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.030
This saves you

22:20.070 --> 22:21.750
from the fear of carrying silver
on the road

22:21.750 --> 22:22.750
and from the hassle

22:22.750 --> 22:23.790
of being detained and searched

22:23.790 --> 22:25.590
by those guards at the city gate.

22:26.500 --> 22:27.500
[Thirty thousand taels,
payable upon delivery. Undersigned: Gu. ]

22:29.920 --> 22:31.070
If it isn't honored,

22:31.720 --> 22:32.780
I'll be right here.

22:33.240 --> 22:36.440
You can come and trash my establishment
anytime you want.

22:41.580 --> 22:43.580
This is certainly more convenient.

22:44.270 --> 22:44.870
Very well,

22:45.720 --> 22:46.400
I trust you.

22:50.480 --> 22:51.110
Take care.

22:53.070 --> 22:55.480
Mr. Gu, may I have a draft issued?

22:55.480 --> 22:56.200
Mr. Gu, Mr. Gu.

22:56.200 --> 22:56.720
I need to get a draft!

22:56.720 --> 22:57.790
So all of you want drafts now?

22:57.790 --> 22:58.850
Yes, yes, exactly.

22:59.000 --> 22:59.550
Alright.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.590
Those who need drafts, line up over here.

23:01.590 --> 23:02.440
Okay. Okay.

23:04.350 --> 23:05.400
Don't just stand there.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.440
Bring out some fresh pastries

23:06.440 --> 23:07.240
for everyone.

23:07.790 --> 23:08.450
Right away!

23:11.510 --> 23:12.510
I'm just puzzled.

23:13.480 --> 23:14.720
Since you dislike how the Master

23:14.720 --> 23:16.750
brought down the Eight Families
with underhanded tactics,

23:16.750 --> 23:17.680
why are you so determined

23:17.680 --> 23:19.280
to see your own brother fall?

23:21.720 --> 23:23.450
I just don't want to see him win.

23:31.390 --> 23:32.470
Finally, our money

23:32.470 --> 23:33.470
has been secured.

23:34.400 --> 23:36.160
What a relief.

23:36.200 --> 23:37.640
Thank you, Mr. Gu. We're in your debt.

23:37.640 --> 23:38.480
You're most welcome.

23:38.480 --> 23:39.030
Take care.

23:39.030 --> 23:39.790
Excellent, excellent.

23:39.790 --> 23:40.680
Let's go.

23:51.310 --> 23:52.920
Mr. Gu, the silver carts
have been unloaded.

23:52.010 --> 23:57.180
[Taiyufeng Draft Bank]

23:53.110 --> 23:54.480
How much did we honor in drafts?

23:54.480 --> 23:55.880
Take a look at the ledger.

23:57.380 --> 23:58.710
[Total: 4,700 taels]

24:00.350 --> 24:00.920
Mr. Gu,

24:01.110 --> 24:03.200
it seems you were only focused
on the withdrawals, not the deposits.

24:03.200 --> 24:04.000
Today,

24:04.030 --> 24:05.070
several major restaurant owners

24:05.070 --> 24:06.440
and dye-works proprietors

24:06.440 --> 24:07.240
heard that

24:07.270 --> 24:08.920
a single draft from us
could be credited to an account;

24:08.920 --> 24:09.590
they immediately deposited

24:09.590 --> 24:11.350
several hundred thousand taels more.

24:11.350 --> 24:12.880
Despite a full day of a bank run,

24:12.880 --> 24:14.070
our ledger shows an increase

24:14.070 --> 24:15.390
of over six hundred thousand taels.

24:15.390 --> 24:16.390
How about that!

24:16.670 --> 24:22.150
[Taiyufeng Draft Bank]

24:16.790 --> 24:17.830
In that case,
load up exactly the same amount of silver

24:17.830 --> 24:19.560
that First Madam Jin brought in

24:19.830 --> 24:20.640
and have it

24:20.720 --> 24:21.250
returned

24:21.440 --> 24:22.440
to her overnight.

24:22.720 --> 24:23.400
Take some pastries

24:23.400 --> 24:25.060
for the crew to eat on the road.

24:25.590 --> 24:27.050
We've won today's battle,

24:27.400 --> 24:28.660
and won it decisively.

24:28.920 --> 24:29.580
Right away!

24:51.000 --> 24:51.880
Young Master,

24:52.270 --> 24:54.070
it doesn't look
like we're getting any more business.

24:54.070 --> 24:55.070
Shall we close up?

24:59.790 --> 25:00.790
You're telling me

25:00.790 --> 25:01.960
there's no business
on our very first day open?

25:01.960 --> 25:02.960
Watch your mouth!

25:03.200 --> 25:04.510
I spoke out of turn. I'm a fool.

25:04.510 --> 25:05.550
Don't be angry, Young Master.

25:05.550 --> 25:06.920
May our fortunes flourish!

25:06.920 --> 25:07.380
Get out!

25:07.920 --> 25:08.720
Just put up the shutters already.

25:08.720 --> 25:09.440
The sooner this place goes under,

25:09.440 --> 25:11.640
the sooner we can return to the capital.

25:22.830 --> 25:24.240
Where is my father now?

25:25.680 --> 25:26.480
He's probably

25:27.270 --> 25:28.270
just left Shanxi.

25:30.590 --> 25:32.990
Then you should
write a letter immediately

25:33.640 --> 25:35.640
and send a rider to catch up with him,

25:35.750 --> 25:38.880
so he can also share in the good news
and enjoy the moment.

25:46.550 --> 25:50.080
This is what they call
"operating on credit as the foundation."

25:50.350 --> 25:51.720
They said it,

25:51.880 --> 25:53.030
and they did it—

25:53.920 --> 25:55.650
and that's how they succeeded.

25:57.030 --> 25:57.830
If you ask me,

25:58.480 --> 25:59.610
my father misjudged

26:00.270 --> 26:01.200
this situation.

26:08.000 --> 26:08.800
Young Master,

26:10.030 --> 26:11.630
we need to come up with a plan.

26:15.480 --> 26:16.480
What kind of plan?

26:17.200 --> 26:18.130
If even a bank run

26:18.160 --> 26:19.400
couldn't finish him off,

26:19.400 --> 26:20.460
what else is there?

26:21.070 --> 26:22.510
If we don't kill the tiger,

26:22.510 --> 26:23.640
it will turn and bite us all

26:23.640 --> 26:24.640
when it recovers.

26:25.790 --> 26:27.310
Just sit tight.

26:27.830 --> 26:28.550
I want to see

26:29.000 --> 26:30.200
how many more days
that "Taiping Bank" plaque

26:30.200 --> 26:31.600
can possibly hang there.

26:49.310 --> 26:50.550
These days,

26:50.960 --> 26:52.490
it's truly been remarkable

26:52.830 --> 26:54.960
how a young lady
has been holding together

26:54.960 --> 26:57.020
such a large household all on her own.

27:01.830 --> 27:04.090
Speak of the devil,
and she shall appear.

27:05.550 --> 27:06.480
What were you two

27:06.510 --> 27:08.310
gossiping about behind my back?

27:08.920 --> 27:10.520
Mr. Gu was just praising you,

27:10.720 --> 27:12.200
saying you have a resilient spirit

27:12.200 --> 27:14.000
and are capable of great things.

27:16.750 --> 27:18.070
Resilient spirit?

27:18.440 --> 27:20.200
I wish I could just kill Wang Tiangui

27:20.200 --> 27:21.790
and drag both of you out of here!

27:21.790 --> 27:22.640
And now?

27:23.000 --> 27:24.130
The estate is saved,

27:24.240 --> 27:24.920
but I'm the one left all alone

27:24.920 --> 27:26.240
in that empty place,

27:27.440 --> 27:29.700
while you two are just thrilled about it.

27:29.750 --> 27:31.110
And now, rumors are spreading everywhere

27:31.110 --> 27:32.030
that he's practically

27:32.030 --> 27:33.890
becoming Wang Tiangui's godson.

27:34.720 --> 27:35.750
Whoever started that "godson" talk

27:35.750 --> 27:37.160
is spouting pure nonsense.

27:37.160 --> 27:38.590
Wang Tiangui is only detaining me

27:38.590 --> 27:41.240
because he wants me to lead him
to the King Li's Treasure—

27:41.240 --> 27:42.400
that's why he still won't

27:42.400 --> 27:43.460
release Mr. Chang.

27:44.310 --> 27:45.400
So the legends

27:45.830 --> 27:47.790
about the King Li's Treasure are real?

27:47.790 --> 27:48.920
How should I know?

27:49.920 --> 27:50.960
But I recall my teacher

27:50.960 --> 27:51.750
once saying:

27:52.070 --> 27:54.070
everything in this world

27:54.070 --> 27:55.400
has its rightful owner.

27:55.440 --> 27:56.920
Some things simply aren't yours—

27:56.920 --> 27:58.640
even if you seize them,
they'll be of no use.

27:58.640 --> 28:01.100
Only the virtuous
are meant to possess them.

28:02.400 --> 28:03.350
Oh, here we go

28:03.590 --> 28:04.920
with the classical proverbs again.

28:04.920 --> 28:06.550
There it is—
the pedantic airs of a scholar are back.

28:06.550 --> 28:07.110
Sorry.

28:12.960 --> 28:13.590
Mr. Gu,

28:14.270 --> 28:15.750
I'm afraid Wang Tiangui

28:16.550 --> 28:18.010
is still not done with you.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.200
You must find a way

28:20.510 --> 28:21.640
to escape his grasp.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.770
He's a man with no lineage to preserve—

28:26.590 --> 28:29.030
vicious at heart
and ruthless in his actions.

28:29.030 --> 28:29.890
You can't trust

28:30.030 --> 28:31.230
a single word he says.

28:31.510 --> 28:32.640
I'm well aware.

28:33.240 --> 28:35.300
This battle hasn't even started yet.

28:36.400 --> 28:37.400
Let me advise you:

28:37.680 --> 28:39.000
you've already pushed him

28:39.000 --> 28:40.920
into the position of chief manager
for the Eight Families;

28:40.920 --> 28:42.270
that's achievement enough.

28:42.270 --> 28:43.790
Everyone has seen

28:44.200 --> 28:45.590
your skill and capability;

28:45.590 --> 28:47.120
even a man like Wang Tiangui

28:47.440 --> 28:49.100
has to treat you with respect.

28:50.160 --> 28:52.350
This is the perfect time
for you to make your exit.

28:52.350 --> 28:54.750
Don't throw that away
out of stubbornness.

28:56.110 --> 28:56.710
Mr. Chang,

28:57.790 --> 28:59.030
if I don't personally

28:59.110 --> 29:00.070
bring down Wang Tiangui

29:00.070 --> 29:01.750
and secure your freedom this time,

29:01.750 --> 29:03.350
I will never forgive myself.

29:05.160 --> 29:07.070
A true man, in navigating life
and society,

29:07.070 --> 29:08.790
must be clear about friendship and enmity.

29:08.790 --> 29:09.640
I will always remember

29:09.640 --> 29:10.770
your kindness to me.

29:11.070 --> 29:12.310
I may not speak of it often,

29:12.310 --> 29:14.240
but that doesn't mean I'm unaware.

29:16.960 --> 29:17.480
Now,

29:18.880 --> 29:20.350
I should return to the bank—

29:20.350 --> 29:22.480
Wang Tiangui is likely looking for me.

29:22.750 --> 29:23.310
In the next couple of days,

29:23.310 --> 29:25.000
I'll make a trip to Jinyang Villa.

29:25.000 --> 29:27.310
Those elders
have just regained their footing,

29:27.310 --> 29:27.960
and now

29:28.000 --> 29:29.440
that I've stepped down as chief manager,

29:29.440 --> 29:30.480
I can finally catch my breath.

29:30.480 --> 29:31.510
It's time to visit them.

29:31.510 --> 29:31.960
Okay.

30:21.000 --> 30:21.660
Leave me be.

30:22.310 --> 30:23.310
Cry if you want to.

30:24.950 --> 30:26.150
How can I leave you be?

30:26.830 --> 30:27.690
Are you a ghost?

30:29.960 --> 30:31.420
I'm worse off than a ghost.

30:33.480 --> 30:35.140
At least a ghost may be reborn—

30:35.310 --> 30:36.110
there's hope.

30:37.310 --> 30:38.370
What hope do I have?

30:47.750 --> 30:48.510
It's late.

30:49.400 --> 30:50.200
Enough tears.

30:54.720 --> 30:55.240
Come,

30:56.110 --> 30:57.240
let me walk you back.

31:07.680 --> 31:10.510
You weren't eavesdropping
on my talk with Father, were you?

31:10.510 --> 31:10.960
No.

31:11.200 --> 31:12.400
What did you discuss?

31:12.750 --> 31:13.550
Nothing much.

31:14.350 --> 31:15.810
He did praise you, though.

31:17.900 --> 31:19.050
If Mr. Chang doesn't blame me
for dragging him into this,

31:19.050 --> 31:20.310
that's blessing enough.

31:20.310 --> 31:21.910
I dare not expect his praise.

31:24.680 --> 31:26.100
Stop saying

31:26.160 --> 31:27.960
you're neither human nor ghost,

31:27.960 --> 31:29.890
as though life isn't worth living.

31:30.550 --> 31:31.880
If you truly felt that way,

31:31.880 --> 31:33.400
why did you escape

31:33.440 --> 31:34.640
from Ningguta at all?

31:35.550 --> 31:37.280
You will live on, and live well.

31:37.350 --> 31:37.960
You

31:38.350 --> 31:39.160
and my father,

31:39.920 --> 31:41.450
both of you are good people.

31:43.550 --> 31:44.510
I often wonder,

31:45.480 --> 31:47.210
if you hadn't gone to Ningguta,

31:47.960 --> 31:50.030
if I hadn't stirred up so much trouble,

31:50.030 --> 31:50.590
maybe your life

31:50.590 --> 31:51.850
would've been easier.

31:53.750 --> 31:54.480
Gu,

31:56.790 --> 31:58.350
I've come to a realization.

31:58.920 --> 31:59.850
Will you hear it?

32:00.590 --> 32:01.160
I will.

32:03.140 --> 32:04.170
I sincerely

32:04.200 --> 32:05.960
do not regret going to Ningguta.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.490
I do not regret meeting you.

32:07.960 --> 32:09.720
And I sincerely hope

32:09.750 --> 32:11.950
that you and my father will soon be free—

32:12.110 --> 32:13.330
that all who've harmed you

32:13.330 --> 32:14.110
will be gone,

32:15.000 --> 32:16.000
that you'll

32:16.350 --> 32:18.270
return home, see your family,

32:18.960 --> 32:20.220
honor your betrothal,

32:21.000 --> 32:22.730
and live out your days in peace.

32:25.000 --> 32:25.830
As for myself,

32:25.880 --> 32:27.350
I too will live a good life.

32:28.480 --> 32:29.510
Even if I wander the world

32:29.510 --> 32:30.640
with my father,

32:31.270 --> 32:33.590
having known you in this life—

32:34.990 --> 32:35.850
that is enough.

32:38.350 --> 32:40.830
To aid the desperate
and rescue the imperiled

32:40.830 --> 32:41.400
in their hour of greatest need—

32:41.400 --> 32:43.130
that is the code of the Jianghu.

32:47.350 --> 32:49.150
Let us both be at peace with that.

34:38.360 --> 34:39.150
I'm home.

34:41.710 --> 34:42.360
See?

34:43.230 --> 34:45.630
Even you can be
left speechless sometimes.

34:47.630 --> 34:48.400
Gu,

34:49.880 --> 34:51.280
is your heart at ease now?

34:52.760 --> 34:55.090
Where the heart rests,
there lies my home.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.330
So sentimental.

35:11.800 --> 35:16.760
[Fenglingdu Inn]

35:14.110 --> 35:14.840
Is Mr. Li from the capital

35:14.840 --> 35:16.100
staying here tonight?

35:17.960 --> 35:18.560
What is it?

35:19.510 --> 35:20.630
I've been riding for two days—

35:20.630 --> 35:22.960
I've come all the way
from Pingyao with a message.

35:22.960 --> 35:24.620
It seems that lad surnamed Gu

35:24.800 --> 35:26.730
is resorting to such a petty trick.

35:27.320 --> 35:28.630
I fear your Taiping Bank may not

35:28.630 --> 35:30.560
hold its ground in Shanxi anymore.

35:32.230 --> 35:33.490
So close, yet so far.

35:33.840 --> 35:35.630
Back when His Highness caught them

35:35.630 --> 35:37.520
at Jinyang Villa, I said,

35:37.590 --> 35:38.720
"Don't let them go."

35:39.710 --> 35:41.860
But he thought holding their IOU

35:42.360 --> 35:43.560
meant no one

35:43.590 --> 35:44.920
would dare renege.

35:47.590 --> 35:48.480
I know

35:49.190 --> 35:51.070
you deposited funds in all eight families

35:51.070 --> 35:52.730
precisely for a run like this.

35:53.440 --> 35:55.190
At the time, I didn't fully grasp it.

35:55.190 --> 35:56.590
Now I see:

35:56.880 --> 35:59.320
"To take, you must first give."

35:59.670 --> 36:00.630
Truly shrewd.

36:01.800 --> 36:03.510
Just withdraw the money

36:03.670 --> 36:05.470
and see if they can withstand it.

36:10.000 --> 36:11.230
"Dead silver stays,

36:11.840 --> 36:13.700
and living silver returns home."

36:14.920 --> 36:16.850
Do you understand what that means?

36:17.760 --> 36:18.630
It means the silver

36:18.630 --> 36:19.760
that's just sitting there stays,

36:19.760 --> 36:21.490
and the rest comes back, right?

36:23.280 --> 36:25.010
Half a year before you arrived,

36:25.190 --> 36:26.550
we deposited over 6 million
taels of silver

36:26.550 --> 36:27.710
with the Eight Families

36:27.710 --> 36:29.070
through other firms.

36:29.920 --> 36:31.190
The plan was

36:31.230 --> 36:32.750
to suddenly strike during a run,

36:32.750 --> 36:33.920
demanding the full withdrawal

36:33.920 --> 36:34.920
all at once

36:35.070 --> 36:36.630
to force them to shut down.

36:38.440 --> 36:39.550
That move

36:39.630 --> 36:41.030
was set long ago.

36:42.630 --> 36:44.090
But judging by the letter,

36:45.070 --> 36:47.070
it seems we're not making that move—

36:47.340 --> 36:49.340
we're just leaving the money there.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.340
How can that be?

36:52.360 --> 36:53.590
That's handing them

36:53.590 --> 36:55.150
a huge advantage for nothing.

36:55.150 --> 36:56.710
Then go ahead

36:56.710 --> 36:57.850
with the plan!

36:58.190 --> 36:59.590
Since we're leaving anyway,

36:59.590 --> 37:01.360
there's no reason
to suffer such a crushing defeat.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.400
I'll write to the Master at once.

37:02.400 --> 37:03.280
What for?

37:03.760 --> 37:04.440
We've already followed
your advice this far,

37:04.440 --> 37:05.770
and look where it got us.

37:06.280 --> 37:07.030
Stop it!

37:15.320 --> 37:16.320
I have an idea—

37:16.360 --> 37:17.800
we could still fight back.

37:17.800 --> 37:18.930
Want to give it a try?

37:20.920 --> 37:21.720
Young Master,

37:22.150 --> 37:23.810
please don't act recklessly.

37:25.110 --> 37:27.440
Oh, so only you're allowed to be reckless?

37:34.070 --> 37:34.550
Today,

37:35.030 --> 37:36.360
the kitchen is fully stocked,

37:36.360 --> 37:37.400
and they'll be serving around the clock.

37:37.400 --> 37:39.330
Eat, drink, and enjoy yourselves!

37:44.280 --> 37:44.960
Mr. Sun,

37:45.790 --> 37:47.520
I suppose our dishes

37:47.760 --> 37:49.120
still can't compare

37:49.150 --> 37:51.010
to those few bowls of spoiled rice

37:51.440 --> 37:53.440
you enjoyed the other day, can they?

38:00.000 --> 38:01.860
Don't mention that spoiled rice!

38:07.710 --> 38:08.030
Madam,

38:08.030 --> 38:09.400
could we please not

38:09.400 --> 38:09.670
bring that up again?

38:09.670 --> 38:10.760
Just hearing about it

38:10.760 --> 38:11.590
makes my throat itch

38:11.590 --> 38:13.720
as if a little hand were scratching it.

38:14.630 --> 38:15.280
Madam.

38:19.020 --> 38:19.480
Come on.

38:29.110 --> 38:29.670
Mr. Gu,

38:29.920 --> 38:30.980
take a look at this.

38:36.030 --> 38:36.630
What is it?

38:37.940 --> 38:40.430
[A withdrawal of six million taels
is scheduled for prior to noon tomorrow.]

38:38.400 --> 38:40.000
That Li Baiwan

38:40.110 --> 38:41.480
deposited 6 million taels of silver

38:41.480 --> 38:43.340
in our draft banks half a year ago.

38:43.760 --> 38:45.890
Now he wants
to withdraw it all at once.

38:50.090 --> 38:50.800
If we eight families

38:50.800 --> 38:51.920
have to scrape together

38:51.920 --> 38:53.070
6 million taels right now,

38:53.070 --> 38:54.710
our liquidity will be completely drained.

38:54.710 --> 38:55.710
This isn't silver—

38:55.710 --> 38:57.570
it's a blade aimed at our throats.

38:58.360 --> 38:59.150
Even with Mr. Gu's plan

38:59.150 --> 39:00.840
to unite the eight families,

39:00.840 --> 39:01.760
which of us could

39:01.760 --> 39:03.220
withstand a run like this?

39:04.510 --> 39:06.480
The depth of Li Baiwan's scheming

39:08.000 --> 39:09.060
is truly chilling.

39:11.670 --> 39:12.440
Do you

39:13.000 --> 39:14.000
intend to pay him?

39:18.010 --> 39:19.140
What do you suggest?

39:19.800 --> 39:21.130
We'll follow your lead.

39:22.130 --> 39:23.000
In my opinion,

39:23.710 --> 39:24.400
this is Li Baiwan's

39:24.400 --> 39:25.460
final hidden card.

39:26.150 --> 39:27.360
But simply handing it over like this

39:27.360 --> 39:28.080
would be

39:28.230 --> 39:29.150
most unwise.

39:30.150 --> 39:31.150
Since he wants it,

39:31.510 --> 39:33.040
then we shall give it to him.

39:33.550 --> 39:34.480
I'm familiar with Wang Tiangui's accounts

39:34.480 --> 39:35.230
and I can

39:35.760 --> 39:36.760
produce 2 million taels of silver

39:36.760 --> 39:37.840
at once.

39:37.960 --> 39:39.420
What about the rest of you?

39:50.670 --> 39:51.630
I'll contribute

39:52.230 --> 39:53.110
four million.

39:53.630 --> 39:54.560
The full amount?

39:58.190 --> 39:58.850
Excellent.

39:59.630 --> 40:00.360
I'll sweep

40:00.590 --> 40:01.480
our vaults clean

40:01.480 --> 40:03.030
and contribute everything as well.

40:03.030 --> 40:04.160
Is that acceptable?

40:08.030 --> 40:09.430
What kind of deal is this?

40:09.840 --> 40:11.400
M-Me too! Count me in!

40:12.710 --> 40:13.940
What a vicious idea.

40:14.070 --> 40:14.960
I'll go get paper and brush.

40:14.960 --> 40:16.290
Let's settle the score.

40:19.630 --> 40:20.890
Just what is this deal?

40:23.280 --> 40:25.000
Tell me, what's going on?

40:25.070 --> 40:25.960
Don't keep me in suspense!

40:25.960 --> 40:27.190
Mr. Gu has a proposal:

40:28.150 --> 40:30.510
Taiping Bank is offering an interest rate
of 30% on deposits—

40:30.510 --> 40:32.360
a full ten percentage points
higher than ours.

40:32.360 --> 40:33.230
If Li Baiwan

40:33.550 --> 40:34.760
wants to move his funds,

40:34.760 --> 40:35.280
fine.

40:35.840 --> 40:36.840
Let's give him

40:37.280 --> 40:38.760
every tael we have.

40:40.510 --> 40:42.630
We'll turn his own money
against him and live off the interest!

40:42.630 --> 40:44.210
What a splendid plan!

40:44.550 --> 40:45.750
In the back and forth,

40:45.800 --> 40:46.710
this is such a big deal.

40:46.710 --> 40:47.280
Indeed.

40:49.890 --> 40:57.790
[Taiping Bank]

40:58.760 --> 40:59.630
My dear Young Master,

40:59.630 --> 41:00.880
how can you still sleep
at a time like this?

41:00.880 --> 41:01.630
They are already

41:01.630 --> 41:02.800
on our doorstep!

41:03.070 --> 41:04.400
Who is on our doorstep?

41:11.410 --> 41:12.740
[Taiping Bank]

41:15.230 --> 41:15.690
This...

41:15.960 --> 41:16.800
Open the doors.

41:16.800 --> 41:17.840
Can't you see? They're all here

41:17.840 --> 41:18.900
to deposit silver.

41:18.960 --> 41:19.760
They're returning

41:19.760 --> 41:20.760
the 6 million taels of silver?

41:20.760 --> 41:21.660
More than that!

41:21.760 --> 41:22.630
Look—the silver carts

41:22.630 --> 41:23.760
are lined up stretching

41:23.760 --> 41:24.800
over 10 miles beyond Pingyao!

41:24.800 --> 41:26.030
Our interest is 10% higher—

41:26.030 --> 41:26.920
they've brought silver

41:26.920 --> 41:27.840
to earn the interest from us.

41:27.840 --> 41:28.760
The Eight Families

41:28.760 --> 41:29.890
are nearly drained.

41:33.400 --> 41:34.480
I told you to listen to the Master,

41:34.480 --> 41:35.590
but you just had to be stubborn about it.

41:35.590 --> 41:36.030
Well?

41:36.110 --> 41:38.040
Now, do you even dare open the door?

41:40.800 --> 41:41.600
Young Master,

41:41.800 --> 41:42.800
you're actually opening it?

41:42.800 --> 41:44.110
What's the point of fighting me on this?

41:44.110 --> 41:45.510
We must have a clear plan!

41:47.440 --> 41:48.960
Can't you even cover this amount?

41:48.960 --> 41:50.760
I thought you said we were prepared!

41:50.760 --> 41:51.400
Young Master,

41:51.400 --> 41:52.550
even if we had mountains
of gold and silver,

41:52.550 --> 41:54.110
we can't be taken for such fools!

41:54.110 --> 41:55.280
We're about to shutter this place
and return to the capital.

41:55.280 --> 41:56.150
Why offend the Eight Families

41:56.150 --> 41:57.550
and pay them interest on top of it?

41:57.550 --> 41:58.510
What's the point?

41:58.510 --> 42:00.110
We'll be the laughingstock.

42:00.400 --> 42:01.450
Stop knocking!

42:01.800 --> 42:03.660
Everyone inside is dead and gone!

42:04.590 --> 42:05.400
Dead and gone?

42:06.280 --> 42:08.410
Alright then, dead and gone. Let's go.

42:09.280 --> 42:10.940
If we don't open the doors now,

42:11.710 --> 42:13.030
we'll truly have

42:13.070 --> 42:14.130
no place left here.

42:14.960 --> 42:16.490
Have you decided what to do?

42:22.440 --> 42:23.700
I'll follow your lead.

42:28.670 --> 42:30.470
Now you decide to follow my lead?

42:30.800 --> 42:32.230
Fine. Open them.

42:41.230 --> 42:42.000
Mr. Li Qin.

42:44.150 --> 42:44.800
Mr. Gu.

42:46.400 --> 42:48.060
Where are those silver carts?

42:49.150 --> 42:50.170
Come on out!

42:55.480 --> 42:56.480
Just a joke.

42:57.190 --> 42:58.740
In the world of business,

42:58.840 --> 43:00.240
goodwill is everything.

43:00.920 --> 43:01.730
Who would

43:01.760 --> 43:02.880
truly drive someone to ruin? Right?
